      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## MMC MeRITS Scraper - Provisional Year Filter\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow manually scrapes MMC MeRITS provisional doctor registration data for a configured target year. It loads saved resume state, fetches search result pages, parses row links, opens each doctor detail page, extracts matching records, and appends matches to Google Sheets. After each processed doctor it saves progress, enforces a daily target and rate-limit wait, then either continues through rows/pages or stops when the target or final page is reached.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure Google Sheets credentials for the append node and select the destination spreadsheet, sheet, and column mapping.\n- Edit the “0. Config (edit year/target here)” node to set the desired targetYear and dailyTarget.\n- Review the HTTP Request URLs and parsing code nodes to ensure they match the current MMC MeRITS page structure.\n- Set the wait duration in “11. Wait (rate limit)” to a safe interval before running the workflow manually.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the target year, daily quota, output fields, Google Sheets destination, wait interval, and page/detail parsing logic to match different scraping limits or data requirements."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "dc1a4fb0-5dba-438e-8852-2a70c40e8874",
